WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:04.197
Scan: camera, handheld scanner, or type the code.

2
00:00:04.197 --> 00:00:06.317
Type the number on the label or the order. Case and the dash do not matter.

3
00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:11.292
